    -->
    <answer id="lookup-register">
        <p>
            Yes:
        </p>
        <ul>
            <li>
                The <code>ProjectFactory</code> is registered in the global lookup via
                <code>@ServiceProvider</code>; it is found by
                <code>ProjectManager</code>.
            </li>
            <li>
                Each project's lookup publishes the project's services (logical view
                provider, project information, subproject provider, customizer provider,
                project operations, action provider, auxiliary properties), so that other
                modules can find and extend them via
                <code>@ProjectServiceProvider</code>.
            </li>
        </ul>
    </answer>



